WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.045
Split view lets you read records without repeatedly leaving the queue.

00:00:04.045 --> 00:00:05.935
Choose Split in All Tickets.

00:00:05.935 --> 00:00:10.955
Select a row on the left and check the number, owner and description in the right-hand preview.

00:00:10.955 --> 00:00:12.945
Select a different row to compare it.

00:00:12.945 --> 00:00:17.095
When you've found the right issue, use Open ticket to enter its full workspace.
